    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1telemetry_1_1_manager" kindref="compound">Manager</ref> class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This stores configurations from both users and vendors and is passed to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1telemetry_1_1_manager" kindref="compound">Manager</ref> upon construction. (<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_any" kindref="compound">Any</ref> changes to the config after the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1telemetry_1_1_manager" kindref="compound">Manager</ref>&apos;s construction will not have any effect on it).</para>
<para>This struct can be extended as needed to add additional configuration points specific to a vendor&apos;s implementation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
